{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slice through fear in this high-speed 2D hack-and-slash!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.poster.avif?t=1771797067\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.webm?t=1771797067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.mp4?t=1771797067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asbak</strong> is a fast-paced hack-and-slash platformer that weaves the chaos of roguelikes, the depth of character-action RPGs, and the heart of a story-driven adventure into one relentless experience. In a world where the veil between the physical world and the paranormal realm has been torn apart, <i><strong>Demons</strong></i> flood the entire nation and you need to slay them with style \u2014 one battle, one story, one soul at a time.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/562a65fdeccc205fc1f4ccb48b8ffe48.avif?t=1771797067\" width=613 height=204 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/8863795085bc9d4f59ff1c327add639a.poster.avif?t=1771797067\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/8863795085bc9d4f59ff1c327add639a.webm?t=1771797067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/8863795085bc9d4f59ff1c327add639a.mp4?t=1771797067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team of elite demon hunters by forging contracts with <strong><i>Sorcerers</i></strong> \u2014 gifted humans with paranormal powers. Accomplish Demon hunting missions, collect mythical artifacts, and uncover the secrets of the bizarre conspiracy that's been looming over the entire nation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2932110?t=1771797067","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771797067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/64e757644ec36bbb015c2fedb42a29fdc4b72aa2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771797067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/64e757644ec36bbb015c2fedb42a29fdc4b72aa2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771797067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2959920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slice through fear in this high-speed 2D hack-and-slash!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.poster.avif?t=1771797067\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.webm?t=1771797067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/29